:"Fixes [godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14582](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14582)\r\n\r\nAdded an Editor Setting: Text Editor > Completion > \"Auto Brace Complete Mode\" just after \"Auto Brace Complete\", which adds different behavior to \"Auto Brace Complete\" for the user to select. The \"Auto Brace Complete Mode\" setting should always be defaulted to \"Always\" and only appear when advanced setting is enabled.  \r\n\r\nThe modes included in this PR:  \r\n- Always: automatically close the brace independently of where it is inserted \r\n- Before Whitespace: automatically close the brace if inserted before a whitespace \r\n\r\nThese modes functions similar to VSCode brace behavior modes. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"891\" height=\"733\" alt=\"auto_brace\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2b14a50-c3f1-4567-91a2-8bb3d3379e37\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2>Always: </h2>\r\n\r\n![always_auto_brace](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54d3aae8-fa54-40c6-80b8-45b17208eb66)\r\n\r\n<h2>Before Whitespace: </h2>\r\n\r\n![before_whitespace_auto_brace](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a4bab62-7828-4468-b6f4-634a80e6bdf2)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/